/// known-gap: interp has no `on end:` on overlays (it ignores the line)
/// An action called by DES (here `on end:`) may leave out parameters that
/// have defaults, as a call written in Goblin may.
<>P |
    ~n: 0
    act finish(k | 5)
        self >> n |= self >> n + k
    end
xx
overlay Short |
    lasts 1 tick
    on end: finish
end
p <> P | n: 0
overlay Short on p at 1
tick()
tick()
say(p >> n)
